/-!
# Odd-order binary displacement

Binary p-group displacement satisfies the finite-field divisibility condition.
For a Frobenius subgroup of order fifty-five, this and the commutator rank
bound give displacement at least eight for a complement generator.
Self-duality and a commuting fixed-point-free cubic actor give displacement
at least twelve for a faithful order-seven actor, hence full displacement
on a twelve-dimensional module.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith H.12.1, printed p.394. Group witnesses and the
actual self-duality equivalence remain explicit inputs to these generic bounds.
-/
